<report>
<title>Dunnett multiple comparisons with a control</title>

<p>Critical value (|d|) = @{d:roundu}<br />
Pooled standard deviation = @{psd:roundu}</p>

<p>Control  <subtotal>(n)</subtotal> = @control  <subtotal>(@{cn:roundu})</subtotal></p>
<block name="sizes_note"><p><warn>@note</warn></p></block>

<table>
<tr><th>Comparison  <subtotal>(n)</subtotal></th><th>Mean difference <ci>(@{pc:round2}% CI)</ci></th><th></th></tr>
<block name="differences"><tr><td>@level  <subtotal>(@{cn:roundu})</subtotal></td><td>@{delta:roundu} <ci>(@{lci:roundu}  to  @{uci:roundu})</ci></td><td><pval>@{p:pval}</pval></td></tr></block>
</table>
</report>
